.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>함수형</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">componentDidUpdate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prevProps<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prevState<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> snapshot<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h3 id=\"unmount\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#unmount\" aria-label=\"unmount permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>unmount</h3>\n<p>: 컴포넌트가 사라질 때  </p>\n<h4 id=\"클래스형-2\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%81%B4%EB%9E%98%EC%8A%A4%ED%98%95-2\" aria-label=\"클래스형 2 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>클래스형</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">...</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"함수형-2\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%ED%98%95-2\" aria-label=\"함수형 2 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>함수형</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">componentWillUnmount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>","excerpt":"클래스형 & 함수형 컴포넌트  클래스형 컴포넌트 (class component) class 키워드 필요 Component로 상속 필요 render() 메소드 필수  함수형 컴포넌트 (function component) state, lifeCycle 관련 기능 사용 불가능\n→ Hook 사용  Lifecycle mount : 컴포넌트가 생성될 때   클래스형 함수형 update : 컴포넌트가 업데이트 될 때   클래스형 함수형 unmount : 컴포넌트가 사라질 때   클래스형 함수형","frontmatter":{"date":"September 28, 2023","title":"[Web] React - 클래스형 & 함수형 컴포넌트","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/class_and_function_component/"}},"next":{"id":"1460b69c-ec17-593b-a9f7-d6640890989d","html":"<h1 id=\"paging--segmentation\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#paging--segmentation\" aria-label=\"paging  segmentation permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Paging &#x26; Segmentation</h1>\n<br>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>외부 단편화</strong> : 물리적 메모리의 빈 공간으로 인해 발생하는 문제\n<strong>내부 단편화</strong> : 할당된 메모리의 내부 공간이 비효율적으로 사용되는 문제</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"paging\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#paging\" aria-label=\"paging permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Paging</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.55555555555556%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"paging 기법\"\n        title=\"paging 기법\"\n        src=\"/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/37523/paging.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/e9ff0/paging.png 180w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/f21e7/paging.png 360w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/37523/paging.png 720w,\n/static/6bdef6a533fc35d80556d2dbcd783156/906b5/paging.png 950w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><strong>→ 프로세스의 주소 공간을 고정된 사이즈의 페이지 단위로 나누어 물리적 메모리에 불연속적으로 할당하는 방식</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>물리적 메모리를 고정된 크기 블록인 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">Frame</code></strong>으로 분할하고, 논리적 메모리를 동일한 크기의 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">Page</code></strong>로 분할</li>\n<li>논리적 주소를 페이지 번호와 오프셋으로 나타냄</li>\n<li>페이지와 프레임을 대응시키는 page mapping 과정 필요</li>\n<li>페이지 테이블에 각 페이지 번호와 해당 페이지가 할당된 프레임의 시작 물리 주소 저장</li>\n<li>구현이 간단하여 효율적인 메모리 사용 가능</li>\n<li>연속적이지 않은 공간도 활용할 수 있기 때문에 <strong>외부 단편화 문제 해결</strong></li>\n<li>프로세스의 크기가 페이지 크기의 배수가 아닐 경우 마지막 페이지에 <strong>내부 단편화 발생</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"segmentation\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#segmentation\" aria-label=\"segmentation permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Segmentation</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 53.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"segmentation 기법\"\n        title=\"segmentation 기법\"\n        src=\"/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/37523/segmentation.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/e9ff0/segmentation.png 180w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/f21e7/segmentation.png 360w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/37523/segmentation.png 720w,\n/static/19711c638afaae8154263762355b9fef/906b5/segmentation.png 950w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>    </p>\n<p><strong>→ 프로세스를 서로 크기가 다른 논리적인 블록 단위인 세그먼트로 분할하여 메모리에 연속적으로 할당하는 방식</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>메모리를 가변 크기의 <strong><code class=\"language-text\">segment</code></strong>로 분할</li>\n<li>각 세그먼트는 프로그램의 논리적 단위에 해당 (함수, 데이터 구조 등)</li>\n<li>논리적 주소는 세그먼트 번호와 오프셋으로 나타냄</li>\n<li>세그먼트의 크기가 서로 다르기에 프로세스가 메모리에 적재될 때 빈 공간을 찾아 할당</li>\n<li>mapping을 위한 segment table 필요</li>\n<li>프로세스가 필요한 메모리 공간만큼 메모리를 할당하기에 <strong>내부 단편화 발생 X</strong></li>\n<li>중간에 메모리를 해제하면 <strong>외부 단편화 발생</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/860\">https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/860</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"September 26, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - Paging & Segmentation","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/paging_and_segmentation/"}},"prev":{"id":"32e15fc7-6bab-5054-add2-7d364289f7bc","html":"<h1 id=\"react-hooks\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#react-hooks\" aria-label=\"react hooks permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>React Hooks</h1>\n<br>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hook은 React 16.8에 새로 추가된 기능입니다. Hook은 class를 작성하지 않고도 state와 다른 React의 기능들을 사용할 수 있게 해줍니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>→ <code class=\"language-text\">Hook</code>은 함수형 컴포넌트에서 사용하던 기능을 사용할 수 있게 해주는 함수</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용-배경\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EB%B0%B0%EA%B2%BD\" aria-label=\"사용 배경 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용 배경</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>클래스형 컴포넌트는 문법이 어렵고, 코드의 재사용성이 낮으며 축소가 어려움</li>\n<li>이러한 클래스형 컴포넌트의 단점을 보완하기 위해 <code class=\"language-text\">함수형 컴포넌트</code> 등장</li>\n<li>함수형 컴포넌트에서는 클래스형 컴포넌트의 장점인 State나 Life Cycle Method을 다루는 기능 사용 불가능</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><em>→ 이를 해결하기 위해 <code class=\"language-text\">Hook</code> 등장</em></strong></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용-규칙\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EA%B7%9C%EC%B9%99\" aria-label=\"사용 규칙 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용 규칙</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hook은 그냥 JavaScript 함수이지만, 두 가지 규칙을 준수해야 합니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>최상위(at the top level)</strong>에서만 Hook을 호출해야 합니다. 반복문, 조건문, 중첩된 함수 내에서 Hook을 실행하지 마세요.</li>\n<li><strong>React 함수 컴포넌트</strong> 내에서만 Hook을 호출해야 합니다. 일반 JavaScript 함수에서는 Hook을 호출해서는 안 됩니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"기본-hook\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-hook\" aria-label=\"기본 hook permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>기본 hook</h2>\n<h3 id=\"usestate\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usestate\" aria-label=\"usestate permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useState</h3>\n<p>컴포넌트의 state(상태) 관리  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setState<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>initialState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h3 id=\"useeffect\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#useeffect\" aria-label=\"useeffect permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useEffect</h3>\n<p>컴포넌트의 상태 주기에 따라 실행할 코드 관리  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>setup<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dependencies<span class=\"token operator\">?</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<br>\n<h3 id=\"usecontext\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usecontext\" aria-label=\"usecontext permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useContext</h3>\n<p>컴포넌트 전역 상태 관리  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useContext</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>MyContext<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://defineall.tistory.com/900#toc1\">https://defineall.tistory.com/900#toc1</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"September 28, 2023","title":"[Web] React - React Hooks","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/hooks/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/Web/React/class_and_function_component/","nextSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/paging_and_segmentation/","prevSlug":"/Web/React/hooks/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}